<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman rates Servico a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman rates Servico a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said analyst Joyce Minor initiated coverage of Servico Inc with a buy rating and a one-year price target of $26.</p>
<p>-- The stock was flat at 19-7/8.</p>
</text>
